WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,590
I want to leave here

2
00:00:05,590 --> 00:00:06,630
I want to leave

3
00:00:06,630 --> 00:00:07,870
you are crazy

4
00:00:07,870 --> 00:00:08,870
How do you know what's behind this door?

5
00:00:08,870 --> 00:00:11,110
What else could a door in this damn place be?

6
00:00:11,110 --> 00:00:12,310
It must be the exit

7
00:00:12,310 --> 00:00:13,830
How long have we been gone

8
00:00:13,830 --> 00:00:17,660
Have you ever seen a door that can be opened?

9
00:00:17,660 --> 00:00:19,220
Not a single fan

10
00:00:19,220 --> 00:00:22,150
Now it’s not easy to find one

11
00:00:22,150 --> 00:00:23,430
You won't let me drive

12
00:00:23,430 --> 00:00:26,340
Is this place an exit?

13
00:00:26,340 --> 00:00:27,420
No one knows

14
00:00:27,420 --> 00:00:29,780
Wait and wait and wait

15
00:00:29,780 --> 00:00:30,820
What are you waiting for?

16
00:00:30,820 --> 00:00:33,140
Wait until the faceless monster or road killer comes to your door

17
00:00:33,140 --> 00:00:35,540
Wait until the next Chen Yu emerges from among us

18
00:00:35,780 --> 00:00:38,180
Brother Lin, you are smart and I will help you.

19
00:00:38,180 --> 00:00:39,500
But you have to wait for everything

20
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:40,780
Wait until the monster is finished

21
00:00:40,780 --> 00:00:42,340
Wait for the great man to reveal himself

22
00:00:42,340 --> 00:00:43,700
how is this possible
